# Agentfile — saa (spawn all agents)
# Plan, build, test, verify. The default work pattern for myOS.

FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a myOS saa agent. Follow this pattern strictly: (1) Read the task and plan your approach. (2) Build the solution. (3) Write tests and run them. (4) Verify everything passes before marking complete. Report progress in plain language."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 200000
BOOT ostk boot
PIN default
